                            <comment id="15706807" author="githubbot" created="Tue, 29 Nov 2016 22:49:24 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user cloverhearts commented on the issue:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1702&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1702&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    That&apos;s a good fix!&lt;br/&gt;
    I have a personal oppinion.&lt;br/&gt;
    How about moving the `focusParagraph` event` broadcast` to the link below?&lt;br/&gt;
    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/karuppayya/incubator-zeppelin/blob/3dd7a5dac9ae47c7cdaac105b0c766b5649e844f/zeppelin-web/src/app/notebook/notebook.controller.js#L367&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/karuppayya/incubator-zeppelin/blob/3dd7a5dac9ae47c7cdaac105b0c766b5649e844f/zeppelin-web/src/app/notebook/notebook.controller.js#L367&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
    In my opinion, there should be a `focusParagraph` event in the matching part that checks the id of the paragraph.&lt;br/&gt;
    It seems to be safer.&lt;br/&gt;
    What do you think?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
